w rt { font-size: 0.45em; opacity: 0.75; }\n.uc-egw b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--zh, #C8453C); }\n.uc-egr { font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; opacity: 0.7; }\n.uc-egg { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.62; }\n.uc-tip { margin: 10px auto 0; max-width: 30em; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; opacity: 0.8; }\n.uc-like { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; }\n.uc-like b { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 3px 0 6px; }\n"}}, "version": 1, "createdAt": 1793318400000, "updatedAt": 1793318400000, "forkedFrom": null}, "cards": [{"id": "u_jahira_1", "num": "1", "type": "kana", "fields": {"Kana": "あ", "Romaji": "a", "Note": "", "Pair": "in katakana <b>ア</b>", "Examples": "<span class=\"uc-egl\">as in</span><div class=\"uc-egw\"><b>あ</b>る</div><div class=\"uc-egr\">aru</div><div class=\"uc-egg\">to be</div>", "Tip": "", "Like": "easily mistaken for <b>お</b>o"}}, {"id": "u_jahira_2", "num": "2", "type": "kana", "fields": {"Kana": "い", "Romaji": "i", "Note": "", "Pair": "in katakana <b>イ</b>", "Examples": "<span class=\"uc-egl\">as in</span><div class=\"uc-egw\"><b>い</b>る</div><div class=\"uc-egr\">iru</div><div class=\"uc-egg\">to be (of animate objects)</div>", "Tip": "after an “e” sound it usually lengthens that vowel instead: せんせい is said “sensē”", "Like": "easily mistaken for <b>り</b>ri"}}, {"id": "u_jahira_3", "num": "3", "type": "kana", "fields": {"Kana": "う", "Romaji": "u", "Note": "", "Pair": "in katakana <b>ウ</b>", "Examples": "<span class=\"uc-egl\">as in</span><div class=\"uc-egw\"><b>う</b>え</div><div class=\"uc-egr\">ue</div><div class=\"uc-egg\">above · written 上</div>", "Tip": "after an “o” or “u” sound it usually lengthens that vowel instead: がっこう is said “gakkō”", "Like": ""}}, {"id": "u_jahira_4", "num": "4", "type": "kana", "fields": {"Kana": "え", "Romaji": "e", "Note": "", "Pair": "in katakana <b>エ</b>", "Examples": "<span class=\"uc-egl\">as in</span><div class=\"uc-egw\"><b>え</b>いご</div><div class=\"uc-egr\">eigo</div><div class